{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20529","headline":"新除水曹郎答白舍人见贺 · 张籍","name":"新除水曹郎答白舍人见贺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年过五十到南宫，章句无名荷至公。\n黄纸开呈相府後，朱衣引入谢班中。\n诸曹纵许爲仙侣，羣吏多嫌是老翁。\n最幸紫薇郎见爱，独称官与古人同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}